{{- /* HD voice: Preferred Vocoder choices 1 to 6 of account 1 (P57, P58, P59, P60, P61, P62; Grandstream config templates, "Preferred Vocoder"): 0 PCMU, 8 PCMA, 9 G.722, 123 Opus (the models that have it; payload type P2385 stays at its default 123). Order G.722, Opus, PCMU, PCMA; the choices after the last codec repeat it, which the phone ignores, so no other codec is offered. Another account of a multi-account model has its own choice keys (account 2 P451 to P456, account 3 P551 to P556, and so on in steps of 100); Hello provisions account 1. Unverified on hardware (verify). */}}
    9
{{- if .Codecs.Opus}}
